 t\, paste the caption and hashtags\, then Post. Or on a computer: my.snapc
 hat.com > Upload to Spotlight. Vertical video\, 60s or less. Caption is in
  the kit.\n\nKit: https://syzigy-media.vijostudio.com/posts/motivational-q
